/ Les photos d'un objet en carousel, en haut de sa fiche (contrôleur
  `photo-carousel`). Une photo touchée s'ouvre en plein écran, où l'on continue
  de faire défiler les autres. Locaux : `photos` (pièces jointes enregistrées),
  `source` (la classe qui sert les variantes, `MapFeature.photo_source`) et
  `alt` (le nom de l'objet). Facultatif : `remote_urls`, des photos restées
  ailleurs (relevés d'observations.be), montrées depuis leur adresse d'origine,
  après les pièces jointes et sans envoyer de referer.
- remote_urls = local_assigns.fetch(:remote_urls, [])
- images = photos.map { |photo| [url_for(source.photo_source(photo, :preview)), nil] } + \
           remote_urls.map { |url| [url, "no-referrer"] }
- several = images.size > 1
- arrow_css = "flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/90 text-stone-700 shadow-sm hover:bg-white disabled:opacity-0"
- big_arrow_css = "flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/50 text-white hover:bg-black/70 disabled:opacity-0"
- track_css = "flex snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overscroll-x-contain [scrollbar-width:none] [&::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden"
div.relative data-controller="photo-carousel" data-photo-carousel="true"
  ul class="#{track_css} h-44 bg-stone-100" data-photo-carousel-target="track" data-action="scroll->photo-carousel#scrolled"
    - images.each_with_index do |(url, referrer), index|
      li.h-full.w-full.shrink-0.snap-center
        button[type="button" class="block h-full w-full" data-index=index
               data-action="photo-carousel#open" aria-label="Agrandir la photo #{index + 1}"]
          = image_tag url, alt: "#{alt} — photo #{index + 1}", referrerpolicy: referrer,
                      loading: (index.zero? ? "eager" : "lazy"), class: "h-full w-full object-cover"
  - if several
    div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-2 top-1/2 flex -translate-y-1/2 justify-between"
      button.pointer-events-auto[type="button" class=arrow_css data-action="photo-carousel#previous"
                                 data-photo-carousel-previous="true" aria-label="Photo précédente"]
        svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
          polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"
      button.pointer-events-auto[type="button" class=arrow_css data-action="photo-carousel#next"
                                 data-photo-carousel-next="true" aria-label="Photo suivante"]
        svg.h-5.w-5 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
          polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"
    span[class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-2 right-2 rounded-full bg-black/60 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium tabular-nums text-white"
         data-photo-carousel-target="counter"] = "1 / #{images.size}"

  / Le plein écran : un `<dialog>` natif, au-dessus de la carte.
  / Taille posée en ligne : celle du navigateur (`max-height: calc(100% - 2em)`)
    l'emportait sur les classes et laissait voir la fiche en bas de l'écran.
  dialog[class="bg-black p-0 text-white [&::backdrop]:bg-black/90"
         style="margin: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100dvh; max-width: none; max-height: none"
         aria-label="Photos — #{alt}"
         data-photo-carousel-target="dialog"
         data-action="close->photo-carousel#closed keydown->photo-carousel#keydown click->photo-carousel#backdrop"]
    ul class="#{track_css} h-full" data-photo-carousel-target="dialogTrack" data-action="scroll->photo-carousel#dialogScrolled"
      - images.each_with_index do |(url, referrer), index|
        li.flex.h-full.w-full.shrink-0.snap-center.items-center.justify-center.p-2 data-photo-carousel-backdrop="true"
          = image_tag url, alt: "#{alt} — photo #{index + 1}", loading: "lazy", referrerpolicy: referrer,
                      class: "max-h-full max-w-full object-contain"
    div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/60 to-transparent px-3 py-3"
      span.text-sm.font-medium.tabular-nums data-photo-carousel-target="dialogCounter" = "1 / #{images.size}"
      button[type="button" class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-black/50 text-white outline-none hover:bg-black/70 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
             data-action="photo-carousel#close" aria-label="Fermer la photo" autofocus=true]
        svg.h-6.w-6 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
          line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"
          line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"
    - if several
      div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-3 top-1/2 flex -translate-y-1/2 justify-between"
        button.pointer-events-auto[type="button" class=big_arrow_css data-action="photo-carousel#dialogPrevious"
                                   data-photo-carousel-previous="true" aria-label="Photo précédente"]
          svg.h-7.w-7 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
            polyline points="15 18 9 12 15 6"
        button.pointer-events-auto[type="button" class=big_arrow_css data-action="photo-carousel#dialogNext"
                                   data-photo-carousel-next="true" aria-label="Photo suivante"]
          svg.h-7.w-7 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"
            polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"
